# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import lib/cadkernel/space.dl
import tests/cadkernel/lengthen3/main.dl

set splineResult to the cad line nurbs from (the cad zero vector3) to (a cad vector3 with x 2.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) of degree 3
require lengthening splineResult's valid
set approximation to the cad spline polyline of splineResult's value at precision 20
require lengthening approximation's valid
require lengthening ((the length of approximation's points) = 2)
set path to the cad arclength curve3 through approximation's points with closure false
require lengthening path's valid
lengthening close (the cad length of path's value) to 2.0
set samples to the cad bezier samples of approximation's points with 8 segments
require lengthening ((the length of samples) = 9)
set union to the cad line union from (the cad zero vector3) to (the cad x axis) and from (the cad x axis) to (a cad vector3 with x 2.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) within 1e-9
require lengthening union's valid
free samples
set source to a list containing the cad zero vector3
set targetPoints to a list containing the cad y axis
set alignment to the cad alignment from source to targetPoints scaling two pairs false
require lengthening alignment's valid
lengthening close (the cad distance from (the cad alignment of (the cad zero vector3) through alignment's value) to (the cad y axis)) to 0.0
free source
free targetPoints
set helix to a cad helix with center (the cad zero vector3), axis (the cad z axis), start (the cad x axis), base radius 2.0, top radius 2.0, height 3.0, turns 1.0 and direction (the cad counterclockwise helix direction)
set helixCurve to the cad helix nurbs of helix
require lengthening helixCurve's valid
set outline to a list containing the cad zero vector3
append the cad x axis to outline
append the cad y axis to outline
lengthening close (the cad ring area of outline) to 0.5
set mesh to the cad spatial triangle soup of outline within (a cad tolerance of 1e-9)
require lengthening ((the length of mesh) = 3)
free mesh
free outline
print "spatial module composition" as a line
